  teacher  >  Mneme teacher family — 2 action(s). Run \`mneme teacher --help\` for actions, or \`mneme teacher <action> --json '{...}'\` to invoke.
  tom  >  Mneme tom family — 2 action(s). Run \`mneme tom --help\` for actions, or \`mneme tom <action> --json '{...}'\` to invoke.
  tot  >  Mneme tot family — 1 action(s). Run \`mneme tot --help\` for actions, or \`mneme tot <action> --json '{...}'\` to invoke.
